.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Generated media and temporary analysis assets
replication/images/
replication/videos/
replication/audio/
replication/edit/
**/*-task.json
**/*-task.json.status.json
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.mov
*.wav
*.mp3
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.webm
*.mov
*.MOV

# Backups and transient orchestrator state markers
*.bak
/generated_pending_qc
/submitting

# Raw image-gen API responses embed base64 image payloads (b64_json) — treat as media
# 覆盖整个 audit 子树(assets/ 与 automation/audit/ 等),避免 base64 大文件污染文本仓
**/audit/**/response.json

# Per-generation video response JSONs carry a download URL to the generated MP4
# (a media pointer) — treat as media, keep out of the text-only repo
**/shots/**/video/*.json
# Any generation audit evidence dirs (base64/URLs) if ever placed in-tree
**/.audit/

# MPEG-TS 分段与其他媒体容器(仓库无 TypeScript 源码)
*.ts
*.m4a
*.aac
*.aiff
*.aif
*.mkv
*.webm

# 自动化管线中间工程态(机器生成、非人类可读)——不入文本仓
# 提交锁 / 互斥锁 / 状态标记
**/*.locked
**/*.lock
**/*.reconciled-submitting
**/*.truncated-corrupt
# 产物哈希校验
**/*.sha256
# 追加式事件台账 / 运行日志 / 错误转储
**/*.ndjson
**/*.log
**/*.err
# automation 目录下的机器状态清单(status/budget/asset_ids 快照)
# 注意:保留 wild-mode/prompts/*-state-*.json(提示词产物)与 *subs-manifest.json(字幕清单)
**/automation/*.paid-state.json
**/automation/manifest.json
